\ forth word (+loop)
: (+loop)
r> swap r> r> \ rt off final initial
rot 2dup + >r \ rt final initial off R: new
>r over - r> \ rt final diff off
rot >r \ rt diff off R: new final
2dup xor \ rt diff off diff^off
rot rot \ rt diff^off diff off
over + \ rt diff^off diff off+diff
xor and \ rt diff^off&(diff^(off+diff))
0< invert if 0 else r> r> 2drop -1 then swap >r ;
